= [+ rr_name +] Repealed

[+ rr_minister +], who holds the [+ rr_committee +] chair for the [+ rr_bloc +], has put the repeal of [+ rr_name +] to the Senate, and the Senate has passed it. [+ rr_line +]

The Caucus can put it to the Senate again, but the [+ rr_bloc +] will be waiting.
